formation\n\nOS: Arch Linux 6.17.9; \nGPU: NVIDIA Corporation TU116M [GeForce GTX 1660 Ti Mobile] (rev a1); \nDrivers: nvidia-dkms 580.105.08-5\n\n### Issue description\n\nBuilt-in functions description in GDshader says that functions `min` and `max` must return integer value when both arguments are int. For example `min(1,2)` must return `1` and `1` will be integer, so this code must be correct: `int foo = max(1,bar); //bar is int`.  But for some reason `max` and `min` (**and probably some other functions**) returns float and error \"can't assing 'float' to 'int'\" appears until `max/min` wraped with `int`: `int foo = int(max(1,bar)); //bar is int`.\nI even \"force casted\" function arguments to int but got the same result:\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"105\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5bd97a20-21df-4558-9772-901c040c8a0d\" />\nIn my opinion it's not a bug, caue GLSL have no bult in `min/max` \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create new project\n2. Create new gdshader\n3. Type `min(` in fragment part of the shader: variant `int min( int a, int b)` should appear in hint window.\n4. Type `int foo = min(1,2);` into fragment part of the shader.\n5. Error message appears (see the picture above) - proving that function returns `float` instead of `int`.\n6. Do the same to `max` function\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n--//--","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115464/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115464/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}